# Review #86 R4-3: REZERO without FORCE is refused on a contact-level
# load, whatever the toolhead Z says (a part under the nozzle at Z 20).
# Exits with an error at REZERO; contact_guard.test does the same with
# FORCE=1 and passes.
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG contact_guard.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

G28
G90
G1 X50 Y50 Z20 F6000
CONTACT_GUARD_SIMULATE LOAD=0 DURATION=0.5
CONTACT_GUARD_SIMULATE LOAD=200000 DURATION=1
ASSERT_GUARD ACTIVE=1 CONTACT=1
SET_CONTACT_GUARD REZERO=1
